sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Vendor as Qualified Vendor
    participant Client as Frontend (MetaMask)
    participant IPFS as Pinata IPFS Cluster
    participant SmartContract as OilTenderingV1 (Proxy)
    participant Keeper as Autonomous Keeper
    participant Indexer as Event Indexer & SQLite

    Note over Vendor,SmartContract: Phase 1: Sealed Bid Commitment (Pre-Deadline)
    Vendor->>Client: Input Bid Amount (e.g., 0.45 ETH) and Technical Specs
    Client->>Client: Generate random 32-byte salt (crypto.getRandomValues)
    Client->>Client: Compute Commitment = keccak256(vendorAddress, bidAmount, salt, tenderId)
    Client->>Client: Save salt and amount to LocalStorage and trigger JSON backup file
    Client->>IPFS: Upload technical specs doc -> returns CID
    Vendor->>Client: Confirm MetaMask transaction
    Client->>SmartContract: submitBid(tenderId, cid, commitment) with EMD value
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Verify caller is vendor, deadline active, valid EMD, no duplicate
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Store Bid in storage array and mark hasBid true
    SmartContract-->>Client: Emit BidSubmitted(tenderId, bidId, vendorAddress)
    Indexer->>SmartContract: eth_getLogs catches BidSubmitted
    Indexer->>Indexer: Store indexed bid in SQLite (quote hidden, status=Submitted)

    Note over Keeper,SmartContract: Phase 2: Automated Bid Opening (Post-Deadline)
    Note over SmartContract: Submission Deadline Expires (block timestamp past openingTime)
    Keeper->>Keeper: Polling detects tender eligible for opening
    Keeper->>SmartContract: openBids(tenderId)
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Verify timestamp past openingTime, status is Created
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Transition status to UnderEvaluation
    SmartContract-->>Keeper: Emit BidsOpened(tenderId, timestamp)
    Indexer->>SmartContract: eth_getLogs catches BidsOpened
    Indexer->>Indexer: Update tender status to UnderEvaluation in SQLite

    Note over Vendor,SmartContract: Phase 3: Cryptographic Reveal (Reveal Window Active)
    Vendor->>Client: Open Tender Detail Page (Status: UnderEvaluation)
    Client->>Client: Retrieve salt and bidAmount from LocalStorage or JSON file
    Vendor->>Client: Click 'Reveal Bid'
    Client->>SmartContract: revealBid(tenderId, bidIndex, bidAmountWei, salt)
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Verify timestamp within reveal window, status UnderEvaluation
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Recompute keccak256(msg.sender, bidAmountWei, salt, tenderId)
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Assert recomputed commitment equals stored commitment
    SmartContract->>SmartContract: Record bidAmount and update status to Opened
    SmartContract-->>Client: Emit BidRevealed(tenderId, bidIndex, vendorAddress, bidAmountWei)
    Indexer->>SmartContract: eth_getLogs catches BidRevealed
    Indexer->>Indexer: Update bid status to Opened and record amount in SQLite
